      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "My uncles and aunts are all married, so I have a lot of cousins as well.",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Because grandfather passed away several years ago, my grandmother lives with my mother’s eldest brother.",
